title: Use market defined by the `Market` trait in the broker pallet

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Rearranges the logic in the `broker` pallet to use the `Market` trait implementation
      to make decisions related to the region pricing and market scheduling.

      This work will be used later to migrate to the market mechanism proposed in the RFC-17.
      It will be achieved by implementing the `Market` trait for the pallet that implements 
      market mechanism specified in RFC-17.
crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: major
